        {
          "id": "overview-f",
          "type": "overview",
          "enabled": true,
          "label": "Overview",
          "title": "All about Mundo Premier",
          "body": "We developed two dynamics for Aeromexico Rewards (formerly Club Premier) members, focused on building loyalty and letting them redeem points for prizes such as all-expense-paid trips. Mundo Premier was carried out in collaboration with Santander as part of the Toma Todo program.",
          "image": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "challenge-g",
          "type": "challenge",
          "enabled": true,
          "title": "Challenge / Problem statement",
          "intro": "Club Premier was looking for a strategic and reliable provider capable of developing interactive experiences for its advertising campaigns within a short development timeline and without any production errors, as any errors could lead to legal issues given the nature of the campaigns.",
          "problems": [
            "Rapid design and development",
            "Reliable end-to-end testing",
            "24/7 support",
            "Reports",
            "Compliance with legal regulations governing games and sweepstakes for auditing purposes",
            "Security & trust"
          ],
          "approachTitle": "Solution",
          "approach": [
            "From day one, we offered a comprehensive solution in which the development timeline was tailored to the client’s desired launch schedule—in this case, a two-month timeline for public launch, with zero margin for error during the launch.",
            "Through constant communication with the client throughout the development process, extensive testing in a staging environment, and stress testing to handle high traffic volumes, we successfully achieved our goal."
          ],
          "images": []
        },
        {
