    "intro": {
      "heading": "Who we are?",
      "body": "At JeeTP Studios, we design and build custom digital products: interactive experiences, video games, apps, and platforms. We’re a team of developers, designers, and strategists who serve as the technical arm of brands and agencies.\n\nWe operate like a factory, not an agency: with no layers of middlemen or unnecessary overhead. That means lower costs, realistic timelines, and the flexibility to scale according to each project."
