      "heading": "Overview",
      "body": "We have developed experiences for loyalty programs, sports leagues, and commercial activations, combining technology with business objectives.\n\nEvery project begins with a brief conversation to understand what needs to be achieved; from there, we define the scope, timeline, and costs, and then we build it."
    },
    "beliefs": {
      "heading": "What do we believe in?",
      "body": "We believe in building products that work for people, not the other way around. From research to design to testing, we don’t stop until we get it right."
